    "title": "Governor Lee invites New York business owners to Tennessee following Mamdani's win - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jaxon Steward ,\n2 hours ago JACKSON, Tenn. — Governor Bill Lee has a public service announcement for New York business owners who don’t like the direction their city is headed. Last night, Zohran Mamdani took home the race for New York city mayor beating former New York Governor Andrew Cuomo and Republican Curtis Sliwa. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
